#: scenario9:scenario9_9F61379E_0202_45A8_9850_9E023C02FA8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0d74d5f1677a55b558b93a8f0166ff6924a759cb4729c96d54c459650ec0c01
#. default-sha256: bc0da33ae1d46c5f331e30bf604e6dc3d58282db19b4f486f62147501ce5d33c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9F61379E_0202_45A8_9850_9E023C02FA8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You... ⟪k:1⟫What are you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무슨…… ⟪k:1⟫소리야……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_16985783_0C9E_45D6_976E_5508F0AB78BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0a7339e20d04461bac62d75797819262dbcc273ea66a5078c2e416bd7091cb5
#. default-sha256: f954fe2ac25d0f7ff7540d52b313738c04f591dec9275bb4ee8f25a8b9e3b073
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_16985783_0C9E_45D6_976E_5508F0AB78BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Extinguish your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫혼을…… ⟪k:1⟫소멸시키라고……?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8708093988bd4a89e9a95c8ef57908c64e6fc897a043221af5688f5f7c663c51
#. default-sha256: 5d36ba851b15eebbffc9d78f09dc052e86e98c612661ddf0a42f08b40570240c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I want it to be you... ⟪k:1⟫who sends me off.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you grant this girl her "
"selfish request?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫당신이 ⟪k:2⟫그래 주시길 바라요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제 마지막 부탁을…… 들어 주시겠나요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9357046487be220b0d7e93c1e5d8fe237921c0efa795320613242f75a8621e41
#. default-sha256: fd15ade1f58fd0d98ddd5ef353950c3d45cb62d2b49988b347f5108d43dab3b7
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but because I wanted to set everyone free from the mansion’s cursed bonds..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누구도…… ⟪k:1⟫이 저택에 남기지 않으려고……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 892236a9edfc6bb33418e5eb7a47cfec6b99b0ebc24321e4eaf4cea2140386a1
#. default-sha256: bb5e605b470ef4ae42bbc1fbaab132fc1dc3d346ae48ec07243e69ea5ee9770c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And you’re asking me... ⟪k:1⟫to eradicate your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그랬는데…… ⟪k:1⟫소멸시키라고……?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e502d2d2ee68956a8dcfe1600c78def482138e5654654e1e2837983ca4c2ca6
#. default-sha256: 1e665cb4f9b68e9a977b91e14283a7313dec1621a7d34c0319dc10972f8834d4
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ be destroyed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫이 자리에서 소멸되어야 할 존재예요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫당신도…… 눈치채지 않으셨나요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c9d92fc5332845efdca5b4f57146895aaee2e9560f69df68bc517f4c889e067
#. default-sha256: 1dc3a5dfded159788b00a55d9a75bec044cb77b28f569161df8fea0258f341ac
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While it’s true Morgana wished for misfortune to befall them... ⟪k:1⟫if I hadn’t been there, "
"none of their tragedies would have taken place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫모르가나의 기도가 ⟪k:1⟫존재하긴 했지만……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫제가 없었다면―― ⟪k:4⟫비극은 안 일어났어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3269873d61237c7b9ee188c8cbac8f2a34e0b4c62e23638fd3511ae4b29713af
#. default-sha256: 09480c4a1672ec706f8fa47ca97e439617971150d077703c7d2a51856c194492
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Culpable?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가해자라고……?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaa63f46c2d5c6e039b0213ed9d172d2434d6c8c6a495cdfe8063325936b3d37
#. default-sha256: c71196b51dd4f0c0b57ebfbf8749c416df6fa68943b51ba3912a86eb9b4a8733
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You didn’t intend for anything bad to befall anyone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 안에는…… ⟪k:1⟫어떠한 악의도 없었어……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_C50A9C00_7CD9_4231_9A74_84B933568663
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2be00f0829bb4a051f402feaf048624f3cc9503428166d7bd15d7702ceb45bc
#. default-sha256: 6911175695ce23415c991c3dff3e958769f048e6d56fdaed3f7d73095171c386
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_C50A9C00_7CD9_4231_9A74_84B933568663"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you say we answer one last lingering question, Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……미셸……, ⟪k:1⟫마지막 수수께끼를 풀죠."

#: scenario9:scenario9_4CB04B8C_CE64_4467_A3FD_D683F1ABE772
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96b0fdf37df0ffae3e56c27e9b07ef6354f222f78d052a0b1ff37e25051daa4a
#. default-sha256: bc33f6ac92cd0d7fda5bfc8cd944560d7776b2fa55a6c97824273feea9856643
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4CB04B8C_CE64_4467_A3FD_D683F1ABE772"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The explanation might be a bit lengthy...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but I would like to share it with you "
"before I depart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫조금 길어지겠지만…… ⟪k:1⟫저란 존재가 누군지……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마지막으로 ⟪k:4⟫말할 기회를 주세요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_674CEFAD_690E_4D6F_8E66_67076AF5F197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26b1a66ab762124f98a3cf451faa9cebdc9d25acefe227cbbad7f1879eca1393
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_674CEFAD_690E_4D6F_8E66_67076AF5F197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario9:scenario9_E6E37D27_E7E9_4AD8_B0AA_20F76E48BEC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4bde62aa6f74f3c6782cce2f5f0de988bba766ed5ff7e526854eb37ef04a667
#. default-sha256: 783629626d2e416e01f798010be4db4505698486027c2362f837c45023f68d1a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E6E37D27_E7E9_4AD8_B0AA_20F76E48BEC2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon her death, Morgana’s soul was afflicted with great pain resulting from the hatred and "
"resentment she bore."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫모르가나가 죽은 순간, ⟪k:1⟫모르가나의 혼은 끔찍한 고통에 시달렸어요. ⟪k:2⟫그건 ⟪k:3⟫증오와 "
"⟪k:4⟫원한에 의한 것인데――"

#: scenario9:scenario9_61E105AB_CBC5_45F8_BB12_D4BBD464AF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5324a8e2ee4458b5d376771f05c8a9e1a9398a881e4f1f9cc21687ebabaac1a
#. default-sha256: dc700beab93fdcfc0df97881e44e22af35eca74b92bd5a2a7c8e7a7a87def8a1
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_61E105AB_CBC5_45F8_BB12_D4BBD464AF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A saint must put herself second to all others.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She must be caring, generous, "
"forgiving.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And she must not bear any ill will for anyone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫성녀는…… 희생적이어야만 해요. ⟪k:1⟫남을 아끼고, ⟪k:2⟫베풀고, ⟪k:3⟫용서하여 ⟪k:4⟫결코 원망해"
"선 안 돼요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_22806235_A709_4C41_AC81_AD9B75A68C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 835c2114e6d3816ecb649c9352fb281da40827a7825ba4d413c7ba1fe6787bed
#. default-sha256: 908b94b58b8bd26821d230d43b514596403288d189d6e3fbe97c18884e8634b2
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_22806235_A709_4C41_AC81_AD9B75A68C5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that’s why you always seemed so... ⟪k:1⟫abnormally pure-hearted..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그런…… ⟪k:1⟫거였나……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_77EC0F48_FACF_421C_A270_9B439BA11A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b70b3e2e91206687f0a1660b073fce19b375e2430233d77724a2749c14c17950
#. default-sha256: a254ee1e846ebc13fe72d289986f5152b8a7092e2ebe88d75f56c33a4387b053
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_77EC0F48_FACF_421C_A270_9B439BA11A86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫네 성질이…… ⟪k:1⟫일관되게…… ⟪k:2⟫과도할 만큼 순수하던 이유가……."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 성질이…… ⟪k:1⟫일관되게…… ⟪k:2⟫과도할 만큼 순수하던 이유가……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_C7844E63_00A8_4A5C_9E40_77B244818EEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7735f3f7188214d1835ec77da3be1c143e449ab8fcc67218bc1e44cf41e446fc
#. default-sha256: 94c7a115ad24c0ac0ebc27c5a3ca663f7c15950896ab64e5339d1781d1a6aa2b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_C7844E63_00A8_4A5C_9E40_77B244818EEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I refuse to accept..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫살아가는 걸…… ⟪k:1⟫바라선…… ⟪k:2⟫안 되었단 말을……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DB5FE44D_E8BF_4FE4_ADC3_359A9861FAAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e21c57659d6bf948fef530e6f801312d1a7da478fd4087e0c4a698e0d8d0f5a
#. default-sha256: eeea9b6ac352327e468b33db776461ad8eb371555d75992326b84d208856a657
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_DB5FE44D_E8BF_4FE4_ADC3_359A9861FAAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was never meant to be a soul of my own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모르가나 곁에 있으며―― 그 일부여야만 했죠."

#: scenario9:scenario9_ED3E19B4_F27A_4DBB_9407_E7BDA4CD3900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fa3852c687e666b3a86898572890f7174065dd52a506d2626c47b7be289cb68
#. default-sha256: 56def5b884b1824481aa9bd7de1a73c6c766d502aaf6d7322c9fc9e5de3c82c1
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_ED3E19B4_F27A_4DBB_9407_E7BDA4CD3900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wished to live,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 바란 건 ⟪k:1⟫존재하는 것."

#: scenario9:scenario9_9A5A72F1_0937_45A3_9907_771883651318
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4dd320b58c458e69c2e50a4867230f71795efaf43c645d3f22bd9c836377bce
#. default-sha256: 66d24fd367533be05464ef2128037f91242f0cf365313635fd14844de62f6ad0
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9A5A72F1_0937_45A3_9907_771883651318"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but your own wish?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 소망 때문이었구나……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_01EDA556_A383_47E5_9362_9F8E1A0E37F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5d577276f0a60daa2ddd7dda125869579c5ee959483400b6f8b66b614eb62fd
#. default-sha256: 56a577b7e3aa178050186e592700a924cc656ab151e68e44fc5c203c44fd891e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_01EDA556_A383_47E5_9362_9F8E1A0E37F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Which meant that my wish... ⟪k:1⟫had the consequence of granting Morgana’s with it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 ⟪k:1⟫제 소망이…… ⟪k:2⟫모르가나의 기도도 이루고 만 거죠."

#: scenario9:scenario9_EA770485_F763_4E16_90CA_B38FFE952A0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96760cc4686421f08d5d8904b25b641e5f35132433da2d6d4b24e00487976dfb
#. default-sha256: 26242ad733df5293a96744bc85cef290dd8e702b7b29653bc266b4d5a80e2c3a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EA770485_F763_4E16_90CA_B38FFE952A0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The house, having attained perpetuity, served as a place for those reconstructed by "
"Morgana’s curse to return to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저택이 영원히 존재하기에, ⟪k:1⟫재생의 저주를 받은 세 남자는 ⟪k:2⟫그 저택으로 다시 돌아왔어"
"요……."

